-- next-no-identity.stdout --
Git doesn't know who you are
Commits by homebot save and the hourly autosave fail without a name and email.
Run this yourself:
  mkdir -p ~/.config/git && git config --file ~/.config/git/config user.name "Your Name" && git config --file ~/.config/git/config user.email you@example.com
